<title>FRANCE: France sells 350 mln Ecu 2007 OATs at auction.</title>
<headline>France sells 350 mln Ecu 2007 OATs at auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury sold the following government bonds (OATs) at auction on Thursday.</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 25.APR.07	5.50	   350 MLN	   6.17</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS  LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 895 MLN/2.6		     NIL		 95.06</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 100.0						   27.MAR</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT AUCTION</p>
<p>							    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - The Treasury originally announced it would sell 300 to 500 million Ecu of OATs in total today.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
